(7302413, 1138283, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment in time.  The editing while at first was a bit much is growing on me.  It is outside of DPC rules for this challenge, but I image this would rock so much more without the man in the background.</td>', 'Wonderful moment in time.  The editing while at first was a bit much is growing on me.  It is outside of DPC rules for this challenge, but I image this would rock so much more without the man in the background.', '2015-01-15 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302416, 1138292, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on the people in back.  In fact I find the background more interesting than the foreground as the angle on the rider hides his arms and head and is therefore not as strong as it could be.</td>', 'I like the processing on the people in back.  In fact I find the background more interesting than the foreground as the angle on the rider hides his arms and head and is therefore not as strong as it could be.', '2015-01-15 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302417, 1138616, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment in time.  So hard to have falling snow add to a photo, but here it sets a great mood.</td>', 'Wonderful moment in time.  So hard to have falling snow add to a photo, but here it sets a great mood.', '2015-01-15 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302418, 1139321, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  Love the muted colors and reflection.  Perhaps having the man as more of a silhouette would be something to try.  The red shirt seems to break up the mood of the rest of the image.  Also cropping at both the top and bottom to make a panel it may be a stronger composition.</td>', 'Lovely scene.  Love the muted colors and reflection.  Perhaps having the man as more of a silhouette would be something to try.  The red shirt seems to break up the mood of the rest of the image.  Also cropping at both the top and bottom to make a panel it may be a stronger composition.', '2015-01-15 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302419, 1139597, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Great tones.  There may be too many layers here with dilutes the impact of your subject.  I wonder if a crop with just about half of the  land showing would be a more powerful composition.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Great tones.  There may be too many layers here with dilutes the impact of your subject.  I wonder if a crop with just about half of the  land showing would be a more powerful composition.', '2015-01-15 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302420, 1138616, 119012, '<td valign="top">looks like a christmas card, really nice.</td>', 'looks like a christmas card, really nice.', '2015-01-15 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302424, 1138837, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great scene with a nice contrast between the ice and the city.  The processing (HDR, Sharpening Halos, etc.) is a bit too much and detracts from the city portion of the image.</td>', 'Great scene with a nice contrast between the ice and the city.  The processing (HDR, Sharpening Halos, etc.) is a bit too much and detracts from the city portion of the image.', '2015-01-15 11:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302425, 1139447, 119012, '<td valign="top">so much to love about this image considering and i''m not a fan of this style of processing but there is so much here to keep me looking.</td>', 'so much to love about this image considering and i''m not a fan of this style of processing but there is so much here to keep me looking.', '2015-01-15 11:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302426, 1138667, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, seeking a new and interesting viewpoint.  There may be too many competing subjects here (bike, women, seats, roof) that waken the overall effect.</td>', 'I like the idea here, seeking a new and interesting viewpoint.  There may be too many competing subjects here (bike, women, seats, roof) that waken the overall effect.', '2015-01-15 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302430, 1138429, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice angles and clouds.  Is the blue saturation turned up.  It looks somewhat unnatural given the lighting on the rest of the bridge.</td>', 'Nice angles and clouds.  Is the blue saturation turned up.  It looks somewhat unnatural given the lighting on the rest of the bridge.', '2015-01-15 12:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302431, 1139268, 119012, '<td valign="top">this would be so much better if you composed this properly, i.e set the road to be perfectly symmetric and centered. also the structures are leaning left. it feels so off balance.</td>', 'this would be so much better if you composed this properly, i.e set the road to be perfectly symmetric and centered. also the structures are leaning left. it feels so off balance.', '2015-01-15 12:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
