(7302442, 1138837, 119012, '<td valign="top">love the composition but the processing style really detracts from the image for me. <br/> <br/>i may have gone b/w and let the lines do the work.</td>', 'love the composition but the processing style really detracts from the image for me.  i may have gone b/w and let the lines do the work.', '2015-01-15 12:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302445, 1139342, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lovely image with the mist providing a great mood.  I think I would like a crop with either more reflection or less reflection.  Less reflection would emphasize the tree and more reflection would emphasize the reflection.  If you are comfortable cloning, removing the wood fence would create more of wildness of the photo.</td>', 'Lovely image with the mist providing a great mood.  I think I would like a crop with either more reflection or less reflection.  Less reflection would emphasize the tree and more reflection would emphasize the reflection.  If you are comfortable cloning, removing the wood fence would create more of wildness of the photo.', '2015-01-15 12:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302448, 1139602, 91496, '<td valign="top">It is not often you see a show of a falls where the water is moving away from you.  Nicely done.  The vignette (either natural or added) seem a bit strong for my taste.</td>', 'It is not often you see a show of a falls where the water is moving away from you.  Nicely done.  The vignette (either natural or added) seem a bit strong for my taste.', '2015-01-15 12:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302450, 1139552, 119012, '<td valign="top">stellar.</td>', 'stellar.', '2015-01-15 12:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302452, 1139447, 30669, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this shot before from you and it certainly is a great location and nice how you always find a great angle.<br/>That reflection in the little pool of water is very cool. Great job.</td>', 'I''ve seen this shot before from you and it certainly is a great location and nice how you always find a great angle.That reflection in the little pool of water is very cool. Great job.', '2015-01-15 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302453, 1139588, 30669, '<td valign="top">I am from Michigan and this sure looks like the Great Lakes to me. Very wind swept, barren, and bleak yet beautiful. I like the dune grass in foreground and the person walking to give it perspective.</td>', 'I am from Michigan and this sure looks like the Great Lakes to me. Very wind swept, barren, and bleak yet beautiful. I like the dune grass in foreground and the person walking to give it perspective.', '2015-01-15 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302454, 1138388, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the moment that you caught here.  Looks very natural and genuine.  While I am not a big fan of photo-shopping away imperfections, the veins in her feet are the only area of her that is not smooth and soft.  A touch of clone/heal can remove that distraction.</td>', 'Love the moment that you caught here.  Looks very natural and genuine.  While I am not a big fan of photo-shopping away imperfections, the veins in her feet are the only area of her that is not smooth and soft.  A touch of clone/heal can remove that distraction.', '2015-01-15 12:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7302455, 1138468, 119012, '<td valign="top">love it.</td>', 'love it.', '2015-01-15 12:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
