(7302522, 1139006, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo - the lighting makes it dramatic and interesting.  My only complaint is the halo of light around the left side of the hood. This seems like an accident of post production (like in selecting the hood and lightening it, part of the wall was accidentally selected and lightened as well).  Other than that it''s really well done.</td>', 'This is a great photo - the lighting makes it dramatic and interesting.  My only complaint is the halo of light around the left side of the hood. This seems like an accident of post production (like in selecting the hood and lightening it, part of the wall was accidentally selected and lightened as well).  Other than that it''s really well done.', '2015-01-15 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
