(7303068, 1138468, 138253, '<td valign="top">timeless. there''s so much *right* with this picture, from the framing, focus, tone....<br/>easily a 10 and a favorite.<br/>this is the sort of image that, to me, people would buy prints to decorate with.<br/>there is no face, so no "must be someone I know to connect with", and the sense of hope and reunion, coupled with the bit of a puddle (rainy day is done, lets look to the oncoming future) ...well, as I said, there''s so much *right* that I''m sure I would bore people reading this with my words when they can just glance up and take it all in on their own.</td>', 'timeless. there''s so much *right* with this picture, from the framing, focus, tone....easily a 10 and a favorite.this is the sort of image that, to me, people would buy prints to decorate with.there is no face, so no "must be someone I know to connect with", and the sense of hope and reunion, coupled with the bit of a puddle (rainy day is done, lets look to the oncoming future) ...well, as I said, there''s so much *right* that I''m sure I would bore people reading this with my words when they can just glance up and take it all in on their own.', '2015-01-16 11:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
