(7303734, 1138936, 179675, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely composition! A little too much space above her for my liking  though. She''s almost drowning (''scuse the pun) in empty space above her. I feel like she''s battling with the space for center of attention.</td>', 'Quite lovely composition! A little too much space above her for my liking  though. She''s almost drowning (''scuse the pun) in empty space above her. I feel like she''s battling with the space for center of attention.', '2015-01-18 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
