(7303808, 1138273, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like this. That pop of colour and contrast against the snowy backdrop really works. I long for a different composition however, with the flyer positioned further towards the edge and not so centred.</td>', 'I like this. That pop of colour and contrast against the snowy backdrop really works. I long for a different composition however, with the flyer positioned further towards the edge and not so centred.', '2015-01-18 17:51:44.000000', NULL, 1);
