(7304079, 1138872, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is a very clean jelly fish photo. Love the colors and softness. I almost breezed right past it though, because most jelly fish photos are heavily out of focus and noisy due to a combination of aquarium glass and a dark room. Brain said, "Jelly, next." Thankfully my eyes got an extra second to look while my hand was responding to the "next" command and the brain sent out a "whoaaa, wait" command.<br/> <br/>While the capture is very lovely, the orientation feels off to me, and I feel like I want to flip it or crop it differently. My eyes keep bopping across the image looking for a place to land.</td>', 'This is a very clean jelly fish photo. Love the colors and softness. I almost breezed right past it though, because most jelly fish photos are heavily out of focus and noisy due to a combination of aquarium glass and a dark room. Brain said, "Jelly, next." Thankfully my eyes got an extra second to look while my hand was responding to the "next" command and the brain sent out a "whoaaa, wait" command. While the capture is very lovely, the orientation feels off to me, and I feel like I want to flip it or crop it differently. My eyes keep bopping across the image looking for a place to land.', '2015-01-19 11:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304185, 1139294, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a joyful picture!  It shimmers with the interplay of light and color, with an equivalence of form and motion.  It flickers between realism and abstraction.  It''s playful and uplifting.  My personal favorite.</td>', 'What a joyful picture!  It shimmers with the interplay of light and color, with an equivalence of form and motion.  It flickers between realism and abstraction.  It''s playful and uplifting.  My personal favorite.', '2015-01-19 16:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304192, 1139256, 173844, '<td valign="top">Incredibly winning moment.  The image says it all.  My second favorite.</td>', 'Incredibly winning moment.  The image says it all.  My second favorite.', '2015-01-19 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304195, 1139574, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully merges "reality" with cartoonish (perhaps) surrealism.</td>', 'Wonderfully merges "reality" with cartoonish (perhaps) surrealism.', '2015-01-19 17:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304202, 1139451, 173844, '<td valign="top">Impressive biblical mood heightened by the lighting... pity about that pole and wires on the right.</td>', 'Impressive biblical mood heightened by the lighting... pity about that pole and wires on the right.', '2015-01-19 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304227, 1139367, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this image so much but don''t think I can fully elucidate why --  there''s a lot of fugitive beauty here.  A lush spareness that so suits the black and white presentation.  Shadows and figures, perspective, delicate lines that are reminiscent of a stark Miro painting.  Quiet. Masterfully composed.  A lesson in seeing.  My second favorite.</td>', 'I like this image so much but don''t think I can fully elucidate why --  there''s a lot of fugitive beauty here.  A lush spareness that so suits the black and white presentation.  Shadows and figures, perspective, delicate lines that are reminiscent of a stark Miro painting.  Quiet. Masterfully composed.  A lesson in seeing.  My second favorite.', '2015-01-19 19:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304327, 1139080, 173844, '<td valign="top">The trees are sprightly, the clouds are lovely and the moon adds visual punctuation, but what lifts this image into a higher order of beauty is the very satisfying color combination --  blue and yellow with touches of white and dark.</td>', 'The trees are sprightly, the clouds are lovely and the moon adds visual punctuation, but what lifts this image into a higher order of beauty is the very satisfying color combination --  blue and yellow with touches of white and dark.', '2015-01-20 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304329, 1139268, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the spookiness combined with the abundance of light.  Also, the cross-shaped telephone poles in the distance are a fine, subtle touch.</td>', 'I like the spookiness combined with the abundance of light.  Also, the cross-shaped telephone poles in the distance are a fine, subtle touch.', '2015-01-20 08:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304330, 1139459, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Handsome, dignified person, and we can only wonder as to the depth of the eyes.</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Handsome, dignified person, and we can only wonder as to the depth of the eyes.', '2015-01-20 08:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304331, 1139379, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love this landscape. The expansive and interesting foreground, featuring a ribbon of road and its jaggedly parallel white-tipped fence; then the in-your-face immensity of the fronting mountain range, its structure so grandly delineated; then the hints of clouds rising beyond the range (though I do find that dark mustache of a cloud distracting).  So well laid out.  And what beautifully brings it all together is the deep, grainy processing.</td>', 'I love this landscape. The expansive and interesting foreground, featuring a ribbon of road and its jaggedly parallel white-tipped fence; then the in-your-face immensity of the fronting mountain range, its structure so grandly delineated; then the hints of clouds rising beyond the range (though I do find that dark mustache of a cloud distracting).  So well laid out.  And what beautifully brings it all together is the deep, grainy processing.', '2015-01-20 09:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304333, 1139481, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming portrayal of happiness amidst what looks like, to Western eyes at least, scruffiness verging on dilapidation.  Beautiful boy, dog peacefully napping on the unpaved rectangle of dirt and a satisfying happenstance background.  Quite fetching.</td>', 'Charming portrayal of happiness amidst what looks like, to Western eyes at least, scruffiness verging on dilapidation.  Beautiful boy, dog peacefully napping on the unpaved rectangle of dirt and a satisfying happenstance background.  Quite fetching.', '2015-01-20 09:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304334, 1139588, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully bleak.  The person in the midground is perfect.</td>', 'Beautifully bleak.  The person in the midground is perfect.', '2015-01-20 09:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304335, 1139320, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wondrous textures and atmosphere.  Great title, including the use of lower case.  <br/>I can''t believe how many images in this challenge I''m putting into my favorites.</td>', 'Wondrous textures and atmosphere.  Great title, including the use of lower case.  I can''t believe how many images in this challenge I''m putting into my favorites.', '2015-01-20 09:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304337, 1138486, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject, beautiful picture.  Great depth of field.  It''s so satisfying to see the mountainous coast and the pines wrap around and then intermingle.  Couldn''t ask for prettier clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful subject, beautiful picture.  Great depth of field.  It''s so satisfying to see the mountainous coast and the pines wrap around and then intermingle.  Couldn''t ask for prettier clouds.', '2015-01-20 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
