(7304612, 1139547, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stylishly captured NYC icon, its graceful upward curve is centralized in such a way as to invite the surrounding structures to join cause in its reach towards the sky.  I like how the higher horizontal facing eventually pixelates.  In black and white, of course, to highlight form and line.</td>', 'Stylishly captured NYC icon, its graceful upward curve is centralized in such a way as to invite the surrounding structures to join cause in its reach towards the sky.  I like how the higher horizontal facing eventually pixelates.  In black and white, of course, to highlight form and line.', '2015-01-20 17:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
