(7304733, 1139323, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t get over how perfect its fur is - pristine, and looks like it was just brushed for this portrait.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I can''t get over how perfect its fur is - pristine, and looks like it was just brushed for this portrait.  Beautiful.', '2015-01-20 22:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304734, 1138566, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love that you stuck the lamppost dead center.  And love the cobbles, too.</td>', 'I love that you stuck the lamppost dead center.  And love the cobbles, too.', '2015-01-20 22:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304735, 1138408, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s another shot with a lamppost in the center - for some reason, I quite like lampposts in the center, or nearly so.  There''s an interesting sense of longing, for some reason.  At any rate, I quite like the picture!</td>', 'There''s another shot with a lamppost in the center - for some reason, I quite like lampposts in the center, or nearly so.  There''s an interesting sense of longing, for some reason.  At any rate, I quite like the picture!', '2015-01-20 22:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304748, 1139570, 30490, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, amazing color and so crisp and clear.  Hard to believe these grew this way!</td>', 'I really like this shot, amazing color and so crisp and clear.  Hard to believe these grew this way!', '2015-01-20 22:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7304749, 1138463, 30490, '<td valign="top">I''m waiting for your model to break into song.... oh yeah, this isn''t video!  Very interesting image, makes me wonder what the background story is.  I like the symmetry of the photo along with all the colors and the interesting costume!</td>', 'I''m waiting for your model to break into song.... oh yeah, this isn''t video!  Very interesting image, makes me wonder what the background story is.  I like the symmetry of the photo along with all the colors and the interesting costume!', '2015-01-20 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
