(7304954, 1139583, 173844, '<td valign="top">In lingering, I''ve come to appreciate this picture.  The dark fore- and midground backed by a brighter background is quite dramatic, in keeping with the subject matter itself. I also feel that the dark left side is strongly balanced by the right side despite strictures that abjure this kind of central division.</td>', 'In lingering, I''ve come to appreciate this picture.  The dark fore- and midground backed by a brighter background is quite dramatic, in keeping with the subject matter itself. I also feel that the dark left side is strongly balanced by the right side despite strictures that abjure this kind of central division.', '2015-01-21 09:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
