(7305384, 1139583, 13077, '<td valign="top">To me this is sort of torn between being a silhouette and an environmental, story-telling shot. Usually silhouettes are stronger when close up, and story-telling shots tend to work better when there is detail visible throughout. Exposing for the sky brought some nice detail into the clouds, but at the expense of everything else.</td>', 'To me this is sort of torn between being a silhouette and an environmental, story-telling shot. Usually silhouettes are stronger when close up, and story-telling shots tend to work better when there is detail visible throughout. Exposing for the sky brought some nice detail into the clouds, but at the expense of everything else.', '2015-01-21 21:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
