(7305516, 1138265, 19825, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Love the strong pose and light. Sorry I failed to comment earlier.</td>', 'Excellent image. Love the strong pose and light. Sorry I failed to comment earlier.', '2015-01-22 00:16:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7305517, 1139494, 100831, '<td valign="top">well said. I hear the music.</td>', 'well said. I hear the music.', '2015-01-22 00:18:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7305519, 1139290, 30490, '<td valign="top">"Ah, this is so rich. What a perfect example of why the scores on DPC are truly meaningless. This brother of this image won an international photography contest, competing against 11,500 entries from 79 countries. On DPC it didn''t even make it to a 6.0."<br/> <br/>Truly a shame that this photo didn''t score higher and place in the upper half of the challenge.  I struggle with the score issue on here, and I have to keep reminding myself that the value of DPC isn''t the scores or ribbons, but what is gained by entering challenges and expanding my photography skills.  While I''m sorry your photo didn''t do better, it does help me to see someone as talented as you are struggle with the score stuff too.</td>', '"Ah, this is so rich. What a perfect example of why the scores on DPC are truly meaningless. This brother of this image won an international photography contest, competing against 11,500 entries from 79 countries. On DPC it didn''t even make it to a 6.0." Truly a shame that this photo didn''t score higher and place in the upper half of the challenge.  I struggle with the score issue on here, and I have to keep reminding myself that the value of DPC isn''t the scores or ribbons, but what is gained by entering challenges and expanding my photography skills.  While I''m sorry your photo didn''t do better, it does help me to see someone as talented as you are struggle with the score stuff too.', '2015-01-22 00:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7305520, 1138265, 100831, '<td valign="top">This has character. Love the light and expression. Great job.</td>', 'This has character. Love the light and expression. Great job.', '2015-01-22 00:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
