(7305582, 1139006, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Breeee123:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a great photo - the lighting makes it dramatic and interesting.  My only complaint is the halo of light around the left side of the hood. This seems like an accident of post production (like in selecting the hood and lightening it, part of the wall was accidentally selected and lightened as well).  Other than that it''s really well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I intentionally put the ''halo'' in to provide some separation with the background.  The version I published to my <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/thecolliers/13393442114/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Flickr account</a> is the better one and didn''t suffer this problem.</td>', 'Originally posted by Breeee123: This is a great photo - the lighting makes it dramatic and interesting.  My only complaint is the halo of light around the left side of the hood. This seems like an accident of post production (like in selecting the hood and lightening it, part of the wall was accidentally selected and lightened as well).  Other than that it''s really well done.   I intentionally put the ''halo'' in to provide some separation with the background.  The version I published to my Flickr account is the better one and didn''t suffer this problem.', '2015-01-22 07:05:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7305583, 1139006, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by caba:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful lighting extends the fitness, one of the best male body images in DPC, congrats on top 5 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the vote of confidence, but I am happy with the 31st place.</td>', 'Originally posted by caba: Beautiful lighting extends the fitness, one of the best male body images in DPC, congrats on top 5   Thanks for the vote of confidence, but I am happy with the 31st place.', '2015-01-22 07:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
