(7306302, 1138486, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2015-01-24 09:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306305, 1139552, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tome:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the blue Allen and thanks for the detailed lighting description!<br/>I just noticed the two vague shadows from her legs - did you worry about that or did you leave it intentionally? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They are caused by the stripbanks that are behind her at around 45-degree angle.  I never remove them, because if you do, the model will look like she is floating in the air and has no contact with the floor.</td>', 'Originally posted by tome: Congrats on the blue Allen and thanks for the detailed lighting description!I just noticed the two vague shadows from her legs - did you worry about that or did you leave it intentionally?   They are caused by the stripbanks that are behind her at around 45-degree angle.  I never remove them, because if you do, the model will look like she is floating in the air and has no contact with the floor.', '2015-01-24 10:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306404, 1138477, 30049, '<td valign="top">Richard - I was one of the 39 ''under average'' voters on this photo.  The reason for my vote of 4 on this was because of the lack of detail in the critical area of the face.  That and the amount of noise in the photo.  I first thought that the photo may have been underexposed and pulled back, which would have introduced more noise, but after seeing the entry details I see it''s more likely the ISO of 3200.</td>', 'Richard - I was one of the 39 ''under average'' voters on this photo.  The reason for my vote of 4 on this was because of the lack of detail in the critical area of the face.  That and the amount of noise in the photo.  I first thought that the photo may have been underexposed and pulled back, which would have introduced more noise, but after seeing the entry details I see it''s more likely the ISO of 3200.', '2015-01-24 15:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306441, 1138477, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Richard - I was one of the 39 ''under average'' voters on this photo.  The reason for my vote of 4 on this was because of the lack of detail in the critical area of the face.  That and the amount of noise in the photo.  I first thought that the photo may have been underexposed and pulled back, which would have introduced more noise, but after seeing the entry details I see it''s more likely the ISO of 3200. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for the vote of "4".  At least you didn''t give me another "1".</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Richard - I was one of the 39 ''under average'' voters on this photo.  The reason for my vote of 4 on this was because of the lack of detail in the critical area of the face.  That and the amount of noise in the photo.  I first thought that the photo may have been underexposed and pulled back, which would have introduced more noise, but after seeing the entry details I see it''s more likely the ISO of 3200.  Thanks for the vote of "4".  At least you didn''t give me another "1".', '2015-01-24 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306489, 1138395, 43463, '<td valign="top">Serendipitous moments are the best! Well seen and captured! Love how the lighthouse shines it''s beacon to ''guide'' the light of the moon.</td>', 'Serendipitous moments are the best! Well seen and captured! Love how the lighthouse shines it''s beacon to ''guide'' the light of the moon.', '2015-01-24 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306490, 1139340, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion on this chimps face - to me the expression speaks of slight annoyance with whatever/whoever is ''making noise''. As such the moment captured here shows the fingers in the ears to block it out...indeed the title "Hear No Evil" suits this perfectly.</td>', 'Love the emotion on this chimps face - to me the expression speaks of slight annoyance with whatever/whoever is ''making noise''. As such the moment captured here shows the fingers in the ears to block it out...indeed the title "Hear No Evil" suits this perfectly.', '2015-01-24 22:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7306491, 1139552, 43463, '<td valign="top">The pose of the dancer, the composition and lighting are fantastically done. Nice to see you back in the spotlight Allen! Congratulations on your blue!</td>', 'The pose of the dancer, the composition and lighting are fantastically done. Nice to see you back in the spotlight Allen! Congratulations on your blue!', '2015-01-24 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
