(7306560, 1138270, 32997, '<td valign="top">stopped and stared at this shot on a visit here to this gallery, then went to see who took it...<br/>94 huh? you are starting to get somewhere with this photography stuff...<br/>all the info about her is here...not something that could be done with just any model or just any pose...<br/>everything comes together...lips and eyes that leave me wanting more...<br/>knowing what not to show..what is not there...</td>', 'stopped and stared at this shot on a visit here to this gallery, then went to see who took it...94 huh? you are starting to get somewhere with this photography stuff...all the info about her is here...not something that could be done with just any model or just any pose...everything comes together...lips and eyes that leave me wanting more...knowing what not to show..what is not there...', '2015-01-25 10:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
